    "remedy_1": {
      "id": "remedy_1",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Let's repair this one.\n\nA common slip is to compare the sale only with the purchase price. Repairs are part of the investment too.\n\nTrue C.P. = 9000 + 600 = 9600. Profit = 10560 − 9600 = 960, which is 10%.\n\nNow use the same idea with fresh values.",
